        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1275">

                <pb facs="1117" n="803" xml:id="pg803"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1061</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Antwerp</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Diederich</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate General</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Antwerp</hi></placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1914-10-07T15:50:00-05:00" notBefore="1914-10-07T00:00:00+00:00"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">undated</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Received October 7, 1914, 3:30 p.m.</hi>] </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Immediate bombardment announced. Is there no hope intercession American
                    Government to prevent carnage and destruction?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Diederich</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
